commit message:
Started adding performance counters FCI

Rules of thumb to optimize this function further:

    * Inside main FCI loop no double array access (array[i1][i2])
    * Make some of the lookuptables therefore 1D arrays
    * Use small array chunks so that dgemm_ can be perfomed in L2 cache
    * Use as small data types as possible (char, short); throw out long long (lines 392-398 FCI.cpp):

    // Check for the lapack routines { dgemm_ , daxpy_ , dscal_ , dcopy_ , ddot_ }
    unsigned long long maxVecLength = 0;
    for ( unsigned int irrep = 0; irrep < NumIrreps; irrep++ ){
       if ( getVecLength( irrep ) > maxVecLength ){ maxVecLength = getVecLength( irrep ); }
    }
    const unsigned int max_integer = INT_MAX;
    assert( max_integer >= maxVecLength );

const-version of lower(std::string &)

This makes it easier to get lower() versions of const strings.

Signed-off-by: Rodrigo Tobar <rtobar@icrar.org>

Changed definition of AGN mechanical lum

I changed the definition to Equations 11 and 12 in Griffin et al. (2019;
arxiv:1912.09490).

Renamed system.{h,cpp} -> physical_model.{h,cpp}

This aligns the filename with the classes contained within.

Signed-off-by: Rodrigo Tobar <rtobar@icrar.org>
